{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>亞洲職業匹克球巡迴賽在啟德體藝館舉行開幕禮。</p><p></p><p>賽事明天起一連七日舉行，首次來港的女子世界第一職業匹克球手安娜莉沃特斯、香港職業匹克球手王康傑，以及康文署署長陳詠雯等出席開幕禮。同場亦舉行明星挑戰賽，本地及國際球手連同藝人同場競技。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PICKLEBALL-2030_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026phpgaFi36V1792327615.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PICKLEBALL-2030.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XuDTYHJ9BY1792327600.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>巡迴賽為亞洲史上最大規模的職業匹克球錦標賽，逾860名選手，包括男女子世界前六球手參賽，競逐110萬美元、折合約850萬港元總獎金，金額為同類賽事中最高，以及有1,500點排名積分。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T15:39:01.502151+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T22:58:01.288597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T15:37:39.668734+00:00","content_hash":"290ff3fa19cb1a6ea59f8c4abf7f2f97b3848cd536b661e6a8946d5b67fe20c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}